      "description": "Contact · University of Glasgow This website uses cookies to ensure you get the best experience. read more Got it! Vacancies About Us Contact Why UofG Login Register Login Menu Vacancies About Us Why UofG Contact Sign In Home Contact Contact Please contact us with any queries relating to staff recruitment at the University using the form on this page. Our office hours are Monday to Friday, 9am to 5pm. For any other queries, please visit the University website . University of Glasgow Glasgow, G12 8QQ, Scotland View google maps If you are a human, ignore this field * Name * Email * Message Job Reference Number (if applicable) You can find this 6 digit number listed on the job advert logo The University of Glasgow is a registered Scottishcharity: Registration Number SC004401 X Facebook instagram Legal Cookies Terms of use PeopleXD accessibilty statement Candidate privacy notice Accreditation Quick Links About Contact Us Vacancies Salaries Applicant Guide All Right Reserved 2026 University of Glasgow Recruitment website by"
