gy and Cognitive Science Glasgow Grade 7, £41,064 - £46,049 per annum Posted\n13 days\nago The School of Humanities in the College of Arts and Humanities seeks to appoint a Lecturer in Philosophy of Psychology and Cognitive Science. Applications are invited from candidates with an appropriate record of academic achievement in Philosophy, with a proven research and teaching specialism i... Save Job Apply Now Read More Research Associate Glasgow Grade 7 £41,064 - £46,049 per annum Posted\n13 days\nago We have an exciting opportunity for a Research Associate to join our team in the School of Psychology & Neuroscience. Our group examines the offline processing of human memory. We integrate a variety of cutting-edge techniques including behavioural analysis, functional imaging, and brain stimulat... Save Job Apply Now Read More Interim Director of Commercial Finance Glasgow Competitive - Senior Administrative Group, Grade 10 Posted\n14 days\nago Reporting to the Executive Director of Finance, the Director of Commercial Finance, will be responsible for leading the strategic and operational development of the University's commercial activities, driving commercial value, growth and income for the University which supports its strategic obje... Save Job Apply Now Read More Postdoctoral Research Associate in Quantum Sensing with Molecular Spin Qubits Glasgow Grade 7, £41,064 - £46,049 per annum Posted\n14 days\nago To make a leading contribution to a project Developing Quantum Sensing with Molecular Spin Qubits working with Dr. Sam Bayliss. The successful candidate will also be expected to contribute to the formulation and submission of research publications and research proposals as well as help manage and... Save Job Apply Now Read More Lecturer in British Romantic Literature Glasgow Grade 7, £41,064 - £46,049 per annum Posted\n15 days\nago The School of Critical Studies in the College of Arts and Humanities seeks to appoint a Lecturer in Romantic Literature. Applications are invited from candidates with an appropriate record of academic achievement in English Literature, with a proven research and teaching specialism in British Rom... Save Job Apply Now Read More Fire Officer Glasgow Grade 7, £41,064 - £46,049 per annum Posted\n15 days\nago Ready for your next challenge? As a Fire Officer, you'll help safeguard staff, students, visitors and buildings by leading fire risk assessments, strengthening fire safety practices, and partnering with Estates teams to deliver effective, compliant safety solutions. Save Job Apply Now Read More Research Assistant /Research Associate Glasgow Grade 6, £33,951 - £37,694 per annum - Grade 7, £41,064 - £46,049 per annum Posted\n16 days\nago We have an exciting opportunity for a Research Assistant/Associate to contribute/make a leading contribution to a NERC-funded project Sex-specific fitness landscapes in the evolution of egg-laying vs live-birth working closely with Prof Kathryn Elmer and Prof Oscar Gaggiotti (St Andrews) along wi... Save Job Apply Now Read More Demonstrator - James Watt School of Engineering Glasgow Posted\n18 days\nago Applications for this post will only be processed where you are a University of Glasgow student and have been given the vacancy number by your Local School Administrator. Save Job Apply Now Read More Graduate Teaching Assistant - James Watt School of Engineering Glasgow Posted\n18 days\nago Applications for this post will only be processed where you are a University of Glasgow student and have been given the vacancy number by your Local School Administrator. Save Job Apply Now Read More Groom Glasgow Grade 3 £24,685 - £25,249 per annum + 6% allowance Posted\n20 days\nago The School of Biodiversity, One Health and Veterinary Medicine is seeking to appoint a Groom on a permanent basis. You will deliver high standards of organisation and cleanliness within the Equine Hospital by performing routine cleaning and maintenance duties. Undertake daily animal husbandry dut... 