eam at the Small Animal Hospital. You’ll work alongside a skilled team of vets, nu... Save Job Apply Now Read More Technician Glasgow Grade 5 £28,031 - £31,236 per annum Posted\n23 days\nago The School of Cancer Sciences is seeking to appoint a Technician on a permanent basis. You will provide in-depth technical support and knowledge to research groups within the Paul O’Gorman Leukaemia Research Centre (POG-LRC), part of the School of Cancer Sciences (SCS). Save Job Apply Now Read More Research Associate Glasgow Grade 7:  £41,064 - £46,049 per annum Posted\n27 days\nago To make a leading contribution to the ERC-funded project MORTALMED (Mortal Medicine: The Social Life of a Death-Inducing Pharmaceutical). The successful candidate will join an internationally oriented and collaborative project that traces the circulation of sodium pentobarbital across transnation... Save Job Apply Now Read More « First ‹ Prev 1 2 3 Next › Last » Get new jobs for this search by email Sign in or register here to receive emails about new jobs like these The University of Glasgow is a registered Scottishcharity: Registration Number SC004401 X Facebook instagram Legal Cookies Terms of use PeopleXD accessibilty statement Candidate privacy notice Accreditation Quick Links About Contact Us Vacancies Salaries Applicant Guide All Right Reserved 2026 University of Glasgow Recruitment website by Close menu"
