ards are maintained within the Small Animal Hospital. Save Job Apply Now Read More Professor/Reader - Clinical Trials & Methodology Glasgow For salary details, see Job Description Posted\nabout 2 months\nago This senior strategic role offers an exceptional opportunity to lead the next phase of growth within a world-class research environment, supported by strong partnerships with NHS Greater Glasgow and Clyde, extensive interdisciplinary collaboration, and a major programme of campus development. Save Job Apply Now Read More Graduate Teaching Assistant - Economics Glasgow Posted\n3 months\nago Applications for this post will only be processed where you are a University of Glasgow student and have been given the vacancy number by your Local School Administrator. Save Job Apply Now Read More Facilities Manager (Accommodation) Glasgow Grade 7, £41,064 - £46,049 per annum Posted\n3 months\nago Lead facilities delivery for a major university accommodation portfolio. Manage budgets, contracts, compliance and maintenance while driving sustainability and exceptional student experience. Oversee teams and suppliers to ensure safe, high-quality buildings and continuous improvement. Save Job Apply Now Read More Graduate Teaching Assistant - Management Glasgow Posted\n4 months\nago Applications for this post will only be processed where you are a University of Glasgow student and have been given the vacancy number by your Local School Administrator. Save Job Apply Now Read More Graduate Teaching Assistant - Accounting & Finance Glasgow Posted\n4 months\nago Applications for this post will only be processed where you are a University of Glasgow student and have been given the vacancy number by your Local School Administrator. Save Job Apply Now Read More Demonstrator - School of Mathematics & Statistics Glasgow Posted\n11 months\nago Applications for this post will only be processed where you are a University of Glasgow student and have been given the vacancy number by your Local